 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+
+- `ThirdPersonLook` now leaves orbital look axes assigned to a
+  `CinemachineInputAxisController` to Cinemachine, so its Gain is not bypassed by a second
+  event-driven rotation. Ownership is per axis and includes recursive ancestor controllers;
+  disabling a controller or axis entry does not reactivate fallback input. Existing axes
+  without a controller retain event input, and stale input is cleared across handoffs,
+  camera assignment, and look activation. Added setup guidance and EditMode regression tests.
+
 ### Changed
 
 - Replaced NaughtyAttributes (`[ShowIf]`/`[HideIf]`/`[Dropdown]`/`[AllowNesting]`) with Odin
